with size of graph = n, then the n first lines in the bym2 output is normally
what you want, which is the sum of the spatial + iid term. For details see
inla.doc("bym2")

singletons/scale.mode/adjust.for.../ are all taken care of the correct way using
bym2, which also has constr=T as default

